2. GDB: dist/gdb.wasm and dist/gdb.js
-------------------------------------
GNU GDB 17.2 for arm-none-eabi, with the parts of its source tree it links: BFD, opcodes,
libsframe, readline, gdbsupport, libdecnumber, libiberty, gnulib and zlib. GDB, BFD, opcodes,
libsframe, readline, gdbsupport and libdecnumber are under the GNU GPL version 3 or later, and so
is the program as a whole. libiberty and gnulib are under the GNU GPL or LGPL file by file, each
naming version 2, 2.1 or 3, or any later version. zlib is under the zlib licence.

