6. The source
-------------
The arm-none-eabi-gdb-wasm-<version>-sources.tar.gz asset on the GitHub release for this package's
version contains the project checkout, including Dockerfile, build.sh, and the exact source
trees of GDB, GMP, MPFR and Expat used in the build. The release is at
https://github.com/carlosperate/arm-none-eabi-gdb-wasm/releases.
